    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "sigh, another place where we don't release GIL:\r\n\r\n```\r\nThread 1642008 (active+gil): \"Dummy-22\"\r\n    sched_yield (libc.so.6)\r\n    0x15550de3cbdb (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550e10adb5 (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550e10b32a (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550df18454 (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550ddf7836 (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550ddf7f3d (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550ddfaa27 (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15550dfe9b3e (libcuda.so.535.54.03)\r\n    0x15551181490c (libcudart.so.12.0.146)\r\n    cudaLaunchKernel (libcudart.so.12.0.146)\r\n    at::native::gpu_kernel_impl<at::native::FillFunctor<float> > (libtorch_cuda.so)\r\n    at::native::gpu_kernel<at::native::FillFunctor<float> > (libtorch_cuda.so)\r\n    at::native::fill_kernel_cuda(at::TensorIterator&, c10::Scalar const&)::{lambda()#1}::operator() const (libtorch_cuda.so)\r\n    at::native::fill_kernel_cuda (libtorch_cuda.so)\r\n    at::native::fill_out (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::(anonymous namespace)::(anonymous namespace)::wrapper_CUDA_Scalar_fill_ (libtorch_cuda.so)\r\n    at::_ops::fill__Scalar::call (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::native::zero_ (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::(anonymous namespace)::(anonymous namespace)::wrapper_CUDA__zero_ (libtorch_cuda.so)\r\n    torch::ADInplaceOrView::(anonymous namespace)::zero_ (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::VariableType::(anonymous namespace)::zero_ (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::_ops::zero_::call (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::native::zeros_symint (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    c10::impl::wrap_kernel_functor_unboxed_<c10::impl::detail::WrapFunctionIntoFunctor_<c10::CompileTimeFunctionPointer<at::Tensor(c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool>), &at::(anonymous namespace)::(anonymous namespace)::wrapper_CompositeExplicitAutograd__zeros(c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool>)>, at::Tensor, c10::guts::typelist::typelist<c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool> > >, at::Tensor(c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool>)>::call (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::_ops::zeros::redispatch (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    c10::impl::wrap_kernel_functor_unboxed_<c10::impl::detail::WrapFunctionIntoFunctor_<c10::CompileTimeFunctionPointer<at::Tensor(c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool>), &at::(anonymous namespace)::zeros(c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool>)>, at::Tensor, c10::guts::typelist::typelist<c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool> > >, at::Tensor(c10::ArrayRef<c10::SymInt>, c10::optional<c10::ScalarType>, c10::optional<c10::Layout>, c10::optional<c10::Device>, c10::optional<bool>)>::call (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    at::_ops::zeros::call (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::VariableInfo::zeros (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::PyNode::apply (libtorch_python.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::Node::operator() (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::Engine::evaluate_function (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::Engine::thread_main (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::Engine::thread_init (libtorch_cpu.so)\r\n    torch::autograd::python::PythonEngine::thread_init (libtorch_python.so)\r\n    execute_native_thread_routine (thread.cc:106)\r\n    0x15555527ab43 (libc.so.6)\r\n    0x15555530ca00 (libc.so.6)\r\n```\r\n\r\n@Chillee I'm assuming the above is because AOT Autograd is using PyNode?",
