  {
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Well, `c10/util/DeadlockDetection.h` is designed to help you banish calls to GIL in APIs. The extreme idea is probably a bad idea because this test isn't all that fast, so you would need to have a DEBUG only variant of the assert (and get CI coverage on it), but I am definitely amenable to adding this to some critical APIs that you definitely don't want called with GIL.",
