    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "explanation for removing high priority label:\r\n- immediate issue has been addressed\r\n- we'll prioritize reported fixing cases where we are unexpectedly / incorrectly holding the GIL\r\n- better testing is always good but we don't have a prioritized workstream to identify these cases right now (if someone out there wants to help with this, let us know)\r\n- [perhaps somewhat controversial] it may be higher leverage for PT to focus on building better detection/recovery mechanisms outside of process/python due to susceptibility to GIL issues.",
